{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_16_level_st_16-01","storyGroup":"main_16","storySort":236,"storyDependence":"main_16_level_st_16-01","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"16-1","storyName":"庸人的救济","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"最后一位圣愚在狂妄的自辩中走向消亡。多年前，Mantra曾被内卫所纠缠。现在，为寻找失联的Raidian小队，她与罗德岛众人再度直面内卫留下的痕迹。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_st_16-01","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"st_16-01","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"next":1,"characters":["烦躁的贵族","恭敬的近侍","沉默的军人","惊讶的贵族","狂热的贵族","圣愚","？？？","绝望的感染者","“皇帝的利刃”","慌乱的感染者","畏缩的老人","感染者","“迦弗里伊尔”？","阿米娅","Mantra","极境","Mon3tr"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_formal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"cr","id":10},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":11},{"type":"animtext","id":12,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯帝国议会</><p=2>1099年秋</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":13},{"type":"animtextclean","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"6","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1982_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1981_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1981_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的贵族","text":"谁能告诉我，陛下还要放任这场闹剧持续多久？一天、一个月，还是一年？","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的贵族","text":"我真是受够了，维多利亚人早就学会了控制天灾，就连那些蛮荒的魔族都造出了可以在天上飞的战舰。","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的贵族","text":"而我们，却要把时间浪费在商议如何处置这个弄臣小丑上？","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1982_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恭敬的近侍","text":"大人，这是陛下的仁慈......毕竟现在还是有不少民众相信这个疯人拥有某种高尚的品德，陛下也愿意将这场审判公之于众。","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恭敬的近侍","text":"期限是七天，而到刚才为止......已经过去六天又二十一个小时了。","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1981_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的贵族","text":"愚蠢——真是愚蠢！难道我们还要继续忍受这些污言秽语，指望最后一夜的钟声能使那小丑清醒吗？","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1982_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恭敬的近侍","text":"抱歉，大人，恐怕是的。不过，好消息是，在钟声敲响后，帝国议会将在这里发起投票。","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恭敬的近侍","text":"到那时，您就不必再忍受这一切了。从今往后都不必了。","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1981_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的贵族","text":"哼......我当然知道。","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的贵族","text":"好了，滚开吧。就算这丑角之死行将注定，在他真正被埋进土里，或者被烧成灰烬之前......","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的贵族","text":"都还会是乌萨斯仅存的圣愚。","id":35},{"type":"dialog","id":36},{"type":"charslot","id":37},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armyboots_walk","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"ar","id":38},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ar","fadetime":"1","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#4$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的军人","text":"......","id":42},{"type":"dialog","id":43},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armyboots_walk","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"ar","id":44},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ar","fadetime":"2","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":46},{"type":"delay","time":"1.6","id":47},{"type":"charslot","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1981_1#1$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烦躁的贵族","text":"嗯？我是不是看错了？好像是近卫军的制服——","id":50},{"type":"dialog","id":51},{"type":"charslot","id":52},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"cr","id":53},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"cr","fadetime":"1","id":54},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":55},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"4","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊讶的贵族","text":"他又回来了？才休息了五分钟......在之前的演讲里，他甚至连一口水都没喝！","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"狂热的贵族","text":"最后一场演讲——","id":58},{"type":"dialog","id":59},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wtchkgopenftstp","volume":"1","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"所有人都注视着一个衣衫褴褛、格格不入的家伙大步走到议会大厅的中央。","id":62},{"type":"text","text":"他背脊挺直，肢体却松弛，脸上看不出任何对将来的担忧，或为自己的生存而挣扎的痛苦。","id":63},{"type":"text","text":"五分钟前，他才刚在这里发表了一通演讲——关于爱，关于宽恕，关于他如何原谅所有决定杀死他的人。","id":64},{"type":"text","text":"六天的游说已使听众都深觉疲惫，而他却仿佛完全不受影响，只是一抬手，四周就骤然安静。","id":65},{"type":"text","text":"他开口，甚至仍然带着笑意。","id":66},{"type":"dialog","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"我亲爱的朋友们，或者视我为敌的人们，相信我们都清楚，这就是最后了。","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"因此接下来我不会继续谈论爱是何种情状，也不会再大声宣扬我原谅你们将对我施行的一切错误。","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"我将谈论——将来，一个不识字的盲人眼中的将来。","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1966_1#6$1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的军人","text":"......荒谬......","id":72},{"type":"charslot","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"我们需牢记，叙述历史是无上崇高的权力，这样的权力同样容易令人盲目。","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"二十年来，陛下将他的荣光与万民分享，他的子民却没有做好准备以迎接福泽。","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"我从不质疑陛下的仁慈，但是不合时宜的仁慈堪比毒药。","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"叛乱的集团军和北原的感染者，无疑都证明了这一点。","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"卑劣者昂起叛逆的头颅，将他们肮脏的血涂抹在神圣的土地上；狂妄的学者宣称掌握真理，有害的言论如毒虫啃食无辜的心灵。","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"无知的傲慢疯狂滋长，让人民忘记谦卑，让帝国忘记慈爱。伟大的帝国与她的子民离心离德。","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"我看到过去与将来——并非因为智慧，我只是一个愚人，可是未来的走向早已写在过去的车辙中。","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"我丝毫不后悔宣扬我见到的那个将来，哪怕这是将我送上审判台的缘由，我也不得不继续宣扬我看到的预言。","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"我看到了乌萨斯的终局，我看到了一个伟大帝国的陷落。","id":82},{"type":"dialog","id":83},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"cr","id":84},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"4","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"于是今天我站在这里，我恳请陛下，去阻止这一切发生。如果这需要用到我不值一提的性命，那便拿去。","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"如果需要更多的血来洗刷乌萨斯的不洁，我也恳请陛下如是去做——这都是为了更伟大的事业，为了属于乌萨斯的永恒荣光。","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"在这场审判后——无论它以怎样的结果落幕，我都将开启我的圣途。","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"我将一遍又一遍地重申谦卑的美德，试图以这种方式唤回人心重聚，还有帝国的荣光。","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"也许你们会认为我僭越，可我既不领导军队，也不制定律法。","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"也许你们认为我病入膏肓，可我既非疯子，亦非狂人。","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"我双手比流浪者更空，我穿着比感染者更破。我所做的一切——我的过错，只是使人看到不同的历史，倾听不同的声音。","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"使我们不尝试粉饰痛苦，深埋地底的传统将再度被发掘。","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"使我们不尝试淡化残酷，沉寂已久的呼喊得以振聋发聩——","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"到那时，也许，也许我们伟大祖国的未来将焕然一新——所有愤怒都趋于平静，无数罪孽将得到宽恕，而一切痛苦......","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣愚","text":"都会由纯洁的忍耐化解。","id":97},{"type":"dialog","id":98},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":101},{"type":"charslot","id":102},{"type":"background","id":103},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":104},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_heartbeat","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":105},{"type":"animtext","id":106,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯北原荒野</><p=2>■■■■年</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":107},{"type":"animtextclean","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":109},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_speedline","layer":"2","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"——跑！快跑！","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"像其他人那样，一直往前，不要回头！","id":112},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":114},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":115},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.1","id":116},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_bg_bg_snow_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":117},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":118},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowrun","volume":"1","id":119},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleTo":"1.3","duration":"4","block":"false","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":123},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":124},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"sn","fadetime":"3","id":125},{"type":"bgeffect","fade":"true","fadetime":"1.5","layer":"2","id":126},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_snowpowder","fade":"true","fadetime":"3","layer":"1","id":127},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0","grad":"true","fadetime":"3","id":128},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0","grad":"true","fadetime":"3","id":129},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_bg_bg_snow_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"3","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"绝望的感染者","text":"不，我们跑不掉......我们跑不掉的！就算跑出乌萨斯，也是死路——","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","afrom":"1","ato":"1","power":"3","times":"30","duration":"0.3","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"绝望的感染者","text":"咳——咳咳咳！","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你呼吸得太用力了，雪会呛进你的喉咙——","id":139},{"type":"dialog","id":140},{"type":"charslot","id":141},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":142,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowfootstep","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"s","id":143},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"s","fadetime":"2","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"是的。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"血会呛进他的喉咙。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌乱的感染者","text":"咳呃——","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"4","times":"40","isblock":"true","duration":"0.5","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-50","duration":"0.5","id":153},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-100","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":155},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":157},{"type":"charslot","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"——？！","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你挣脱出来了？这么快，怎么——怎么可能——","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"你很聪明，但还不够。你先前向我投射的幻景，某种程度上也是你自己的经历。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"只是，你错在不知道那幻景里的痛苦对我们来说就像妄图撬动山峰的羽毛。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"不过这至少展现了你的能力。你有资格成为“它”的替代品。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我说过，我对你们摆弄邪魔力量的尝试一无所知，也不感兴趣。","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"这并不是一个邀请，而是最后通牒。在我厌倦前，你当然能从我手中救下他们一次、两次......甚至三次。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"但现在我已经厌倦了。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......别再靠近，除非你想带走的只是我的尸体。","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"你的“声音”不再稳定。你开始怀疑自己。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"并非圣愚，却使用它的力量。代价是？","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我不明白你在说什么。","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"万事万物都有代价，你也快接近你的尽头了。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"那也许，尽头是我们会一起死。","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"只有我们。","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"所以，你没有听见。或者你只是已经没有多余的精神去关注更多？","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"你没有听见那些雪地上的脚步声，没有听见你拼个同归于尽也要保护的人......只是一群苟且的虫豸。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"他们其实从来不敢离开故土太远。说着不愿背弃祖国，怀揣极度的侥幸，即使逃亡也刻意蹒跚，或是干脆朝着死亡掉头返还。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"因为离开这里，他们就无法确认自己的存在，即使这存在带来的只有绝望。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"很可惜，你的告诫全无用处。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"什么——","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"就像你告诉他们的。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"“不要回头”。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":196},{"type":"charslot","id":197},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_darkmagic","volume":"1","id":198},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":199},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bdevilmgc","volume":"0.7","id":200},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":201},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":202},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"呃——！","id":204},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"咳、咳咳！咳——嗬——","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"我不想带给乌萨斯一位连身体机理都被破坏殆尽的圣愚，这会浪费很多时间，即使你本身能力超群也并不划算。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"所以，我再次建议你选择放弃挣扎，随我离开。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我也再说一次，我不知道你说的“圣愚”是什么，也对成为它毫无兴趣！","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"而且，就算我现在和你离开，那感染者呢？那些被你们驱赶的......走投无路的......","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"他们会有自己的命运。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......不。","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"我想你必须“说”得更明确些。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我说，不。","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我必须......","id":221},{"type":"charslot","id":222},{"type":"text","text":"安静，紧绷，四下如是。在完整的“话语”自脑海中浮现前，雪依旧飘落，那黑色身躯向前迈步的动作却凝滞了。","id":223},{"type":"text","text":"下一簇新雪尚未触及大地，漆黑的薄雾已在蔓延。","id":224},{"type":"dialog","id":225},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phantommagic","volume":"1","id":226},{"type":"bgeffect","fade":"true","fadetime":"1.5","layer":"1","id":227},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blacksmoke_01","fade":"true","fadetime":"1.5","layer":"2","id":228},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":231},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“留下。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":232},{"type":"subtitle","id":233},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"......","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":237},{"type":"text","text":"他突然不欲继续往前。剥离了理智的另一半认知，则等待着先前的图景再度出现。","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"故技重施......","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":241},{"type":"text","text":"可是没有。什么也没有。","id":242},{"type":"text","text":"只有毫无来由的停滞，只有漆黑自他周身不断散出，从薄雾积累成厚重的尘灰。","id":243},{"type":"text","text":"就像落了一场黑色的雪。","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_077","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"这是——但我没有——","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"......啊。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“皇帝的利刃”","text":"我体内的邪魔发生了轻微泄漏，你竟然能利用我的力量，反过来辖制我？","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_077.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我只是让你困于你体内的秽物包含的......幻影，让你直视你自身。","id":250},{"type":"multiline","name":"？？？","text":"不要试图做无谓的挣扎，否则......","id":251},{"type":"multiline","name":"？？？","end":"true","text":"咳咳。","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"否则，你就会死。","id":253},{"type":"multiline","name":"？？？","text":"在你自己的“国度”里......","id":254},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":255},{"type":"multiline","name":"？？？","end":"true","text":"咳——咳咳咳！！","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"沉睡吧......","id":257},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_2","volume":"1","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"4","times":"40","isblock":"true","duration":"0.5","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-50","duration":"0.5","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-100","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":267},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","id":268},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":269},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":270},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":271},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":272},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"bgeffect","id":274},{"type":"curtain","id":275},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_bg_bg_snow_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":276},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0.6","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":277},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":278},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":280},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","volume":"1","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_093#5","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"天哪，这、这——","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_093_5.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"孩子......孩子！你还好吗？那黑漆漆的怪物难道还追着咱们——","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_093_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_093#4","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"——啊！","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_093_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......咳、咳呃。","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"他不会......再追你们了。","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_093#2","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"什么？","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_093_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"走，离开这里，往南去，在他“醒过来”之前。这次真的不能再回头了。","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你们必须离开这里才能活......","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_093#2","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"你，您说什么？他不会再追我们了？","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_093_2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"这是什么意思？","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_093_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"咳——","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_093#5","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"您是说，您劝服了不通人情的巫怪？","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_093_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"别说了，快走！","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_093#2","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"走......走去哪里？","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_093_2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"传道士大人说过，“背弃故土者永不配自称为人”。我们......我们不愿那样！","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_093_2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"我们不愿背弃陛下、背弃乌萨斯，也不愿背弃您......","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_093_2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"您竟然真能使他不再追来......您救了我们，做到了不可能做到的事，却还是不肯告诉我们您的名字吗？您究竟是谁呢？","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_093_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"这不重要，我......","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_093#4","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"还是说，其实——","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_093_4.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"其实您真的就是那位消失已久的圣愚？","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_093_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......什么......","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_093#4","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"可圣愚应该在圣骏堡富丽堂皇的宫殿里，在陛下的身边。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_093_4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"不......","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_093","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"是了，是了！如果您原本就不属于这里，我们只是窃取了这份恩赐，那被惩罚，也是理所应当。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_093.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_093#3","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"“我们应当忍耐”“我们应当承受”......“我们应当平静”！可我们什么也没有做到......","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_093_3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"就算这样，您还是庇护了我们这些有罪的灵魂。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_093_3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"那您一定就是圣愚。否则，您不会拥有这样的胸怀，向感染者也伸出援手的、同等的博爱。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_093_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_093","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"那么，您的名字就只可能是那一个了，不是吗？","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_093.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"畏缩的老人","text":"那个您不愿我们称颂的名字，那个所有圣愚共同拥有的名字——","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_093.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"cr","id":331},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":332},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":333},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":334},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_avg_dreamrite_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_dreamrite_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":335,"musicid":2},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"4","id":336},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":337},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":338},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“迦弗里伊尔”。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":339},{"type":"subtitle","id":340},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":341},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footsteps_flock","volume":"1","id":342},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.1","yScaleTo":"1.1","duration":"3","block":"false","id":343},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":344},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":345},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":346},{"type":"charslot","id":347},{"type":"background","id":348},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":349},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.6","fillto":"0.6","fadetime":"0.1","id":350},{"type":"image","image":"66_i02","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","y":"70","fadetime":"0","id":351},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"200","xTo":"0","duration":"20","block":"false","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":353},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者","text":"迦弗里伊尔、迦弗里伊尔......","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者","text":"是圣愚，是我们的圣愚回来了！","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者","text":"“圣愚”，是故事书里的那个吗？","id":358},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":360},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":361},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.6","fadetime":"0.1","id":362},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.6","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":363},{"type":"image","image":"66_i02","screenadapt":"coverall","x":"0","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","fadetime":"0","id":364},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"-130","duration":"20","block":"false","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":366},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者","text":"是妈妈说，就算不在我们身边，就算我们得了石头病，也会爱着我们的那个吗？","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者","text":"是的，是她！她回来了！她屏退了恶人，庇佑了凡人，这都是只有圣愚才能做到的事！","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者","text":"圣愚拯救了我们，圣愚——","id":370},{"type":"dialog","id":371},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"curtain","id":374},{"type":"image","image":"66_i02","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","fadetime":"0","id":375},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"30","block":"false","id":376},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":377},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":378},{"type":"text","text":"人群，吵嚷，无数双手不断向她涌来。","id":379},{"type":"text","text":"他们攀扯彼此，像潮水阵阵扑向滩涂，只为能够触及受崇奉者身上的一片衣角，哪怕那只是与他人并无不同的粗布衣衫。","id":380},{"type":"text","text":"被包围的人再也无力支撑，无力思考。抽搐着以膝盖接触雪面的那个瞬间，她几乎就要这样瘫软在地。","id":381},{"type":"text","text":"可是不行。内卫还在这里，想要利用她去杀死更多人的刽子手还在这里，她不能闭眼，不能......放弃。","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“迦弗里伊尔”？","text":"咳——咳呃——","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“迦弗里伊尔”？","text":"呃啊——","id":384},{"type":"text","text":"刹那间她甚至以为自己早已废弃的舌根再度与口腔共振，真切地发出了声音，但身体却只是悄无声息地蜷缩，直到越来越小，越来越小。","id":385},{"type":"text","text":"她忍耐着，等待这痛楚熄灭。","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者","text":"圣愚——","id":387},{"type":"text","text":"并非圣愚，却有代价。","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"可就连被误认的人本身也不知道这荒谬的举动代价几何。也许有时候，“不明代价”，本身就是一种代价。","id":389},{"type":"dialog","id":390},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":391},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"3","id":392},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":393},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"false","id":394},{"type":"cg","id":395,"from":"0","to":"1","duration":"3","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":398},{"type":"image","id":399},{"type":"image","image":"66_i03","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.5","yScale":"1.5","y":"-80","fadetime":"0","id":400},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.5","yScaleFrom":"1.5","xScaleTo":"1.4","yScaleTo":"1.4","duration":"10","block":"false","id":401},{"type":"cg","id":402,"from":"1","to":"0","duration":"0","block":"false"},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"false","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"Mantra女士？怎么了？","id":404},{"type":"dialog","id":405},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_atmosphere_horror","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"at","id":406},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"at","fadetime":"2","id":407},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":408},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"......","id":410},{"type":"dialog","id":411},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"at","fadetime":"4","id":412},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":413,"musicid":3},{"type":"image","image":"66_i03","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"2","id":414},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":415},{"type":"text","text":"领头者沉静的声音蓦地在罗德岛众人的脑海中响起。","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"所有人，停下。","id":417},{"type":"dialog","id":418},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"420","text":"这是......"}},"values":[],"id":419},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":420,"end":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"重复，所有人立刻停下。","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"前方发现邪魔污染。","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"“邪魔污染”？在这？","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"可这里不是离萨米还隔着三分之一个乌萨斯吗？怎么会有——","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士？","id":425,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":426},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"428","text":"这恐怕不是普通的邪魔污染......"},"2":{"id":"428","text":"“国度”。"}},"values":[],"id":427},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":428},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":429},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":430},{"type":"charslot","id":431},{"type":"image","id":432},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":433},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":434},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":435},{"type":"animtext","id":436,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯远北中心矿区</><p=2>1101年秋</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":437},{"type":"animtextclean","id":438},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":439},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"441","text":"Raidian小队最后的坐标就在附近。"}},"values":[],"id":440},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":441,"end":444},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$1","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"根据传回城中据点的信息标记，Raidian小队最后一次发出消息已经是十天之前的事了。","id":443,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"她之前提到的那座研究所，就在前方三公里左右的地方。","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":445},{"type":"charslot","id":446},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"448","text":"Mon3tr，或许你也曾直面过内卫？"},"2":{"id":"448","text":"Mon3tr，你能从这里分析出什么吗？"}},"values":[],"id":447},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":448,"end":457},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#4$1","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我正在看。","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"从污染的规模和形状来看，这真的很像是“国度”留下的污染。","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"没错，这里极可能发生过与内卫的战斗。","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"但是很奇怪，发生过这种烈度的战斗，附近却没有留下任何源石技艺的痕迹。","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#1$1","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"我知道你的担心，博士。","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"如果是Raidian，她一定会设法留下可供我们解读的痕迹。","id":457,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":458},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":459},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"461","text":"这至少说明，这里发生了足以惊动内卫的事。"},"2":{"id":"461","text":"那位女大公显然对我们还有所隐瞒。"}},"values":[],"id":460},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":461},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"463","text":"Raidian小队可能处在极度危险的情况之中。"},"2":{"id":"463","text":"Raidian小队可能已经被这里发生的事波及。"}},"values":[],"id":462},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":463,"end":466},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4204_mantra_1#4$1","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"没错。","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mantra","text":"无论对方是追着Raidian而去，还是为了研究所而来，我们都必须加快速度了。","id":466,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":467},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":468},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":469},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":470},{"type":"charslot","id":471},{"type":"background","id":472},{"type":"image","id":473}],"characters":["烦躁的贵族","恭敬的近侍","沉默的军人","惊讶的贵族","狂热的贵族","圣愚","？？？","绝望的感染者","“皇帝的利刃”","慌乱的感染者","畏缩的老人","感染者","“迦弗里伊尔”？","阿米娅","Mantra","极境","Mon3tr"]}